{
 "about": "Cases for Barkpark's \"$today\" token (api/lib/barkpark/content/today.ex). 'server' per case is Barkpark's answer for that value at 'now' in 'zone'. app/src/lib/today-server.test.ts checks the studio gives the same. Barkpark's api/test/barkpark/content/today_test.exs pins the same cases. Regenerate: elixir scripts/today-cases.exs <barkpark checkout>. G2 / S3 (task-a34b8c24295dd488, task-f78a513602faee55).",
 "cases": [
